B.dFo=new A.t("items",B.S,'Chips: list of { label, icon, values:{kind,label,w,h}, group?, preview? }. `group` names the collapsible section (grouped mode); `preview` picks a distinct thumbnail (e.g. "checkbox", "tabs") when several chips share one base kind.',B.f,null,!1)
