B.dyC=new A.t("allowAddStage",B.W,'Graph layout: show the "add stage" (+) affordance in the milestone header row (default on when `milestoneOrder` is NOT explicitly configured \u2014 stages are then data-derived and lexically ordered, so a new milestone value can be minted to sort strictly between two existing ones). When `milestoneOrder` IS configured, only "add at end" is offered (inserting mid-list would require editing the configured array, not a data write).',B.f,null,!1)
B.dvM=new A.t("allowInsertStep",B.W,'Graph layout: show the "Insert step here" action on the selection toolbar when exactly one edge is selected (default true; needs `milestoneColumn`). Inserting adds a new step into the edge\'s stage (or a freshly minted midpoint stage) and rewires the edge around it; refused with a toast if it would create a cycle.',B.f,null,!1)
