B.dft=new A.db("pinecomposer","The Pine Composer applet surface (pinecomp-1017): a Lego-style TradingView Pine Script v6 builder with four screens \u2014 Build (recipes, block toggles + weights, ADX gate, output options, a live plain-English explainer), Preview (a pure-Dart engine runs the mix on synthetic demo data: price + overlay paint, composite with zero-cross markers, long/cash backtest vs buy & hold), Code (the generated script, copyable, plus a Trace/debug view) and Learn (guided setup, scenario library, walkthrough). Educational; no network egress \u2014 macro blocks compile into the script but are neutral in the preview.",B.bEq,!1)
